<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE AND INDIA TIE TRIANGULAR SERIES MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE AND INDIA TIE TRIANGULAR SERIES MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL, South Africa 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The triangular series day/night match between Zimbabwe and India ended in a tie on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 236-8 in 50 overs. India 236 all out in 49.5 overs.</p>
</text>
